  "slug": "big-rays-rhubarb-relish-recipe",
  "name": "Big Ray's Rhubarb Relish Recipe",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "Use your rhubarb bumper crop to make this rhubarb relish with strawberries, cinnamon, allspice, cloves, and nutmeg.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Stir brown sugar, rhubarb, strawberries, vinegar, cinnamon, allspice, cloves, and nutmeg together in a saucepan over medium heat. Cook and stir until relish thickens, about 30 minutes. Cool, transfer to a sealable container, and store in the refrigerator."
    }
  ],
